block_has.container.settings.time_for_hunter_to_wait=Time For Hunter To Wait (s)
block_has.container.settings.time_for_hunter_to_wait.tooltip=After the box hide and seek game begins, the hiding person takes the lead in entering the map and begins to hide. After waiting in the waiting hall for a period of time, the hunter begins to find the hidden box. [Unit: Second] (machine translation)
block_has.container.settings.number_of_hunters=Number Of Hunters
block_has.container.settings.number_of_hunters.tooltip=When there are a large number of hunters, generally one-fifth of the number of squares is enough; When the number is small, the number of hunters can be twice that of squares. But the number of hunters is at most one less than the box. (machine translation)
block_has.container.settings.tool_cooling_down_time=Tool Cooling Down Time
block_has.container.settings.tool_cooling_down_time.tooltip=The distance detection tool allows hunters to obtain the distance of the nearest square, but this item cannot be used continuously. It has a cooling time. [Unit: Second] (machine translation)
